# Visual fidelity

Pixel target = locked mocks in the current phase spec. Structure + tokens, not photography.

Light chrome only. Screen `bg`, cards/header/composer `surface`. Incoming bubble = white (`#FFFFFF`) + `border-line` on light / gray (`#2A2E3B`) on dark; outgoing = `primary` `#3452D9`. Radius: hub cards ~16, bubbles ~18–20. Type: page titles `font-bold`, section labels `font-semibold`, card/row titles `font-medium`, body/muted `font-normal`. Contact hub title is **SUPPORT** (uppercase). Agent hub **AGENT**. Admin hub **ADMIN**. Launcher / auth wordmark is Messenger Chat.

Do not follow system dark mode. React Navigation chrome (`headerStyle`, `tabBarStyle`) uses `@/lib/tokens`. App UI is Uniwind `className`. Headerless screens (hub, search, chat) share `screenTopPad(insets.top)` via `InScreenHeader` / hub `paddingTop`. Do not `setOptions` a native chat header. Do not StyleSheet the thread. Placeholder shells: `bg-bg` + `bg-surface` card + `border-line` + `text-ink`.

Forbidden looks: nsave maroon, Messenger dark, red outgoing, GIF/mic/camera/thumbs-up composer, in-bubble identity block on every 1:1 message, case-status stepper.

Thread reactions + reply: Meta/Messenger light chrome — swipe right to reply; long-press emoji pill + Reply in a **same-window overlay** (not in-cell, not Modal). Finger-down tints immediately; hold ~150ms opens tray. One spring on the pill (no emoji stagger, no micro-bounce); focused bubble darkens (`bg-ink/12` in, `/25` out). Incoming tray inset right, outgoing inset left. Tap outside dismisses. No extra reaction packages. Fused quote pill, overlapping badge, “Replying to” banner. Receipts = ticks only. Android: edge-to-edge is mandatory and on by default — no `edgeToEdgeEnabled` key in `app.json` (rebuild APK); the `./plugins/with-system-bar-insets` config plugin makes `MainActivity` pad `android.R.id.content` from system-bar WindowInsets after `onCreate` (never hand-edit the generated `MainActivity.kt`); composer/hub/tabs use `useSafeAreaInsets` on **all** platforms; RN `<Modal>` is a separate window that misses that padding — nest a `<SafeAreaProvider>` inside it and read insets from a child; native-stack `disableTopInsetApplication` on Android (MainActivity already pads content). Keep the system 3-button / gesture bar visible. Nav + status bar color = `bg` `#FFFFFF`; dark icons (`windowLight*Bar` + `NavigationBar style="dark"`). Lock `Appearance.setColorScheme('light')` + `AppCompatDelegate.MODE_NIGHT_NO`. `StatusBar style="dark"` only (no JS backgroundColor). Not Messenger dark, not call/video, not thumbs-up composer.

Inbox chips: selected = `bg-primary-soft` + primary text; idle = line/grey. Conversation rows = individual surface cards (`rounded-2xl` + `border-line` + `shadow-md` on `bg`), not separator lines. Hub/help/FAQ cards same chrome. Offers chat (`id: 'offers'`) is pinned first whenever it is in the list. Compose icon visible, **dead**. Unassigned tab: hide chips.

Offers promo: locked hub mock. `"Sponsored"` is the section label only. Carousel `edgePad` 16 on start **and** end; next slide peeks off the right (~78% width). Title + Join Offers stay `px-4`. Background = local `assets/offers/*.png` + dark gradient overlay + white **View offer**. **Join Offers chat** = primary pill + message icon. RN `Image` only (no expo-image). Contact hub has **no tab bar**. Search ≠ Help ≠ FAQ. No scrollbars (`showsVerticalScrollIndicator={false}` + CSS).

Use RN `Image` until the expo-image phase. Do not rewrite `components/ui/*` class strings to chase a mock.
